<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Privacy Policy' }) %>
<main class="narrow auth" data-privacy>
  <a class="auth-brand" href="/"><span class="logo-mark"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'spark', size: 22 }) %></span><span>Skyfly<small>by ScaleForge Business Hub</small></span></a>
  <div class="card legal">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Version <%= version %></p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Business owners and their teams:</strong> name, email address, phone number, business name, a securely hashed password (never the password itself), and the date you accepted our terms. We record sign-ins and important account actions in an activity log for security.</p>
    <p><strong>Your customers (on your behalf):</strong> the order details your customers submit through your pages — such as name, phone number, delivery address, products and totals — and, where you switch it on, email contacts and marketing consent.</p>
    <h2>Why we use it</h2>
    <p>To run your account and business workspace, save and show your orders, send the account emails you need (such as email confirmation and password reset), protect the service against abuse, and meet legal obligations. We do not sell personal information.</p>
    <h2>Who else processes it</h2>
    <p>Only the services needed to run Skyfly, and only for the features you use: our hosting and database provider, our email delivery provider, and — when you connect them — Google Sheets and advertising platforms such as Meta or TikTok for the tracking IDs you add.</p>
    <h2>Separation and security</h2>
    <p>Each business's data is kept separate and is visible only to that business's members (and, for support, to Skyfly's administrators, whose access is logged). Connections use HTTPS, passwords are hashed and stored secrets are encrypted.</p>
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>For as long as your account is active, and afterwards only as long as needed for backups, legal or accounting reasons.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can see and correct your business information in your dashboard. To ask for a copy or deletion of your personal information, contact Skyfly support. Your customers can unsubscribe from marketing emails with the link in every email.</p>
    <p>See also our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>. <a href="/signup">Back to registration</a></p>
  </div>
</main>
</body></html>
